t":"VENT / BLANK PANEL"},{"xPosition":2,"yPosition":12,"text":"THERMAL BREAK"},{"xPosition":0,"yPosition":13,"text":"U5"},{"xPosition":1,"yPosition":13,"text":"LENOVO THINKSMART CORE GEN 2"},{"xPosition":2,"yPosition":13,"text":"ON SR-SHELF-FIXED-1U"},{"xPosition":0,"yPosition":14,"text":"U4"},{"xPosition":1,"yPosition":14,"text":"AVER HUB30"},{"xPosition":2,"yPosition":14,"text":"4K BYOM MATRIX SWITCHER - ON SR-SHELF-FIXED-1U"},{"xPosition":0,"yPosition":15,"text":"U3"},{"xPosition":1,"yPosition":15,"text":"CRESTRON AM3-212"},{"xPosition":2,"yPosition":15,"text":"AIRMEDIA RECEIVER - ON SR-SHELF-FIXED-1U"},{"xPosition":0,"yPosition":16,"text":"U2"},{"xPosition":1,"yPosition":16,"text":"SR-SHELF-FIXED-1U"},{"xPosition":2,"yPosition":16,"text":"SPARE / FUTURE"},{"xPosition":0,"yPosition":17,"text":"U1"},{"xPosition":1,"yPosition":17,"text":"VENT / BLANK PANEL"},{"xPosition":2,"yPosition":17,"text":"INTAKE"}]},{"id":"t94","type":"text","boundingBox":{"x":1180.0,"y":1048.0,"w":1150,"h":320},"text":"NOTES\n1.  THE LISTED SR-CAB-SLIDE-12U WILL NOT HOLD THIS EQUIPMENT LIST. THIS LAYOUT NEEDS 18U.\n     RESIZE THE SLIDE-OUT RACK AND CABINET ACCORDINGLY.\n2.  RU HEIGHTS ARE MANUFACTURER FIGURES: DMF-CI-8 = 2RU; AMP-X300 AND P300 ARE HALF-RACK 1RU;\n     CP4 AND M4250-16XF ARE 1RU. THE TWO AMP-X300 GANG SIDE BY SIDE IN ONE RU.\n3.  DM-NVX-D30 (2) AND DM-NVX-E30 (2) ARE BOX ENDPOINTS AT FIELD LOCATIONS, NOT IN THIS RACK.\n     THE RACK-SIDE NVX IS THE 6 CARDS IN THE DMF-CI-8 (2x D30C + 4x E30C, 6 OF 8 SLOTS).\n4.  M4250-16XF IS ALL-FIBER SFP+ WITH NO COPPER PoE PORTS. THE MICS, CAMERAS, NVX ENDPOINTS,\n     TOUCH PANEL AND THINKSMART CORE ALL NEED COPPER PoE - NO PoE SWITCH IS ON THE LIST. CONFIRM.\n5.  WATTBOX WB-800-IPVM-6 (2) AND WB-250-IPW-2 (2) ARE 0U, REAR-RAIL OR VERTICAL MOUNT. IF FRONT\n     PANEL METERING IS WANTED, SUBSTITUTE THE 1U FACEPLATE SKU.\n6.  CRESTRON AM3-212 KIT APPEARS TWICE ON THE EQUIPMENT LIST. DRAWN AS ONE UNIT - CONFIRM QTY.\n7.  PATCH PANEL SHOWN 24 PORT. CONFIRM DROP COUNT - A 48 PORT 2U MAY BE NEEDED.\n8.  CLOSED CABINET WITH A SLIDE-OUT RACK: AC-RRF7 ROOF FAN IS REQUIRED. VERIFY CABINET DEPTH\n     AGAINST THE DMF-CI-8 AT 15 7/16\" DEEP PLUS SLIDE TRAVEL AND A SERVICE LOOP.\n9.  USB-SW-400 AND AVER HUB30 RU HEIGHTS NOT CONFIRMED - EACH ALLOWED A FULL 1U HERE."},{"id":"t95","type":"text","boundingBox":{"x":2501.2,"y":136.2,"w":460,"h":86},"text":"ALLSHORES"},{"id":"t97","type":"text","boundingBox":{"x":2496.2,"y":299.2,"w":470,"h":272},"text":"ALLSHORES\nExecutive Boardroom\nAV Rack\nFront Elevation"},{"id":"s98","type":"circle","boundingBox":{"x":2625.6,"y":864.0,"w":211.2,"h":211.2},"style":{"stroke":{"color":"#d8d8d8","width":1.2,"style":"solid"},"fill":{"type":"color","color":"#ffffff00"}},"text":"PSI."},{"id":"t99","type":"text","boundingBox":{"x":2506.2,"y":1101.0,"w":450,"h":38},"text":"PRECISE SYSTEMS INTEGRATION"},{"id":"t101","type":"text","boundingBox":{"x":2496.2,"y":1308.0,"w":470,"h":200},"text":"SCALE: NTS\nRACK: 18U x 19\" EIA\nSLIDE-OUT IN CABINET\nROOF FAN: AC INFINITY AC-RRF7\nPOWER: WATTBOX, REAR MOUNT"},{"id":"t103","type":"text","boundingBox":{"x":2496.2,"y":1596.0,"w":470,"h":120},"text":"DATE CREATED: 26/08/24\nCREATED BY: WW\nRev. 1"}],"lines":[{"id":"l3","lineType":"straight","endpoint1":{"type":"positionEndpoint","style":"none","position":{"x":2464.0,"y":41.6}},"endpoint2":{"type":"positionEndpoint","style":"none","position":{"x":2464.0,"y":1878.4}},"stroke":{"color":"#1a1a1a","width":1.2,"style":"solid"}},{"id":"l57","lineType":"straight","endpoint1":{"type":"positionEndpoint","style":"none","position":{"x":248.2,"y":1370.5}},"endpoint2":{"type":"positionEndpoint","style":"none","position":{"x":272.0,"y":1370.5}},"stroke":{"color":"#c8c8c8","width":0.7,"style":"solid"}},{"id":"l59","lineType":"straight","endpoint1":{"type":"positionEndpoint","style":"none","position":{"x":248.2,"y":1304.0}},"endpoint2":{"type":"positionEndpoint","style":"none","position":{"x":272.0,"y":1304.0}},"